{"channelId":"UCq96zhYx8ZhbsxND0MyM_OA","row":["Iron Gait Percherons, Inc. - Draft Horse Rescue & Sanctuary",181,"We want to try to save as many of these massive horses as we physically can by going to auctions and purchasing & saving them from slaughter, owner surrenders as well as helping authority seizures across the USA. We refurbish all their medical, emotional & nutritional needs and find them safe, loving forever homes. Many people are not aware of how wonderful a Percheron performs as a riding companion, through our Rescue we hope to inform the public & community of this simple & rewarding new job for these gentle giants.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq96zhYx8ZhbsxND0MyM_OA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq96zhYx8ZhbsxND0MyM_OA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:54.194Z","channelId":"UCq96zhYx8ZhbsxND0MyM_OA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"38d34cd491d25b810c48b73fe11e4fd0568950f7d64993b4c1fde619e2dc159c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"994f1e540f968636c1b30909a6bb8160e373387e69a8d37c0519546d8e0eadad"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq96zhYx8ZhbsxND0MyM_OA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":181,"raw":"181 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq96zhYx8ZhbsxND0MyM_OA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:54.194Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"We want to try to save as many of these massive horses as we physically can by going to auctions and purchasing & saving them from slaughter, owner surrenders as we